      ],
      "en": "This will we do, if God permits.",
      "ko": "하나님께서 허락하시면 우리가 이것을 하리라",
      "source_text_hash": "50d6660d1aa20d887e9b313c2de136330d03d5ac10be99fc4e6fe2d0f435bec1",
      "translation_text_hash": "538ef4c8a3eb93a5f5edf576a35b261176a30c76698fe9a7548689b5aec65a76",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
