      "en": "For concerning those who were once enlightened and tasted of the heavenly gift, and were made partakers of the Holy Spirit,",
      "ko": "한번 비췸을 얻고 하늘의 은사를 맛보고 성령에 참예한바 되고",
      "source_text_hash": "df1ec5b0f6df1e1399b3f1ccc195b21b8784bcbb4c431284b1aa3ee23ca82129",
      "translation_text_hash": "ab96fa1f4092b74c4a79f6c911e5c2692bad676d745379adf81df7577870dbfe",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "한번 비췸을 얻고 하늘의 은사를 맛보고 성령에 참예한바 되고"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "ab96fa1f4092b74c4a79f6c911e5c2692bad676d745379adf81df7577870dbfe"
      ]
    },
