      "en": "and tasted the good word of God and the powers of the age to come,",
      "ko": "하나님의 선한 말씀과 내세의 능력을 맛보고",
      "source_text_hash": "8910754e2615585f2c25def314d6f72d5ebdb93ef22a6c5a2a7b5ee8dc5ba73e",
      "translation_text_hash": "907a314f9497c89b7c696f2200efdbc22160086a7f2b11b4a2a85779795e6ebe",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
