      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "HEB",
          "chapter": 6,
          "verse": 7
        }
      ],
      "en": "For the land which has drunk the rain that comes often on it and produces a crop suitable for them for whose sake it is also tilled, receives blessing from God;",
      "ko": "땅이 그 위에 자주 내리는 비를 흡수하여 밭 가는 자들의 쓰기에 합당한 채소를 내면 하나님께 복을 받고",
      "source_text_hash": "b269bbf7918c6f06f6d92e3d1a662be08da18a396f707bff4bb007fd84a240b9",
      "translation_text_hash": "3d35e1b25302fbc4b923e64b44afc4fa9790bafc9a3ebd074c8d74192d4f078f",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
